# A failed a_ssert< stops the program with error[assertion], the
# condition as written and the message, at the call (MC34).
== SOURCE
x := 6
"x > 10" a_ssert< "x is big"
x
== ERROR
error[assertion]: assertion failed: x > 10 (x is big)
 --> -e:2:1
  |
2 | "x > 10" a_ssert< "x is big"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
